  "summary": "A short profile of Dr Sten Okwuosa, Convenor of the Impact Pathway Atlas, told largely in his own words. Trained in bibliometrics, Dr Okwuosa describes how the Atlas maps what happens to a finding once it is published, from the citation that arrives late to the narrative CV that recasts an old result and the credit that lands on the wrong paper. The film also marks his Deposit of the Quarter Prize and a body of work that travels well.",
